  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Stellar Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/Galactus_%28Earth-616%29_008.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120426092823\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Galactus (Earth-616) 008\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/Galactus_%28Earth-616%29_008.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120426092823\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/Galactus_%28Earth-616%29_008.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20120426092823 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/Galactus_%28Earth-616%29_008.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120426092823 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Galactus (Earth-616) 008\" width=\"270\" height=\"258\" data-image-key=\"Galactus_%28Earth-616%29_008.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Galactus (Earth-616) 008.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Galactus (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store an infinite amount of stellar-based energies in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>store an infinite or nearly infinite amount of stellar-based energies in your body</b>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Stellar Energy Absorption\">Stellar Energy Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Stellar_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Stellar Transformer\">Bio-Stellar Transformer</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Analysis_&amp;_Discussions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Analysis &amp; Discussions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Stellar Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Stellar Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Stellar Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of containing an infinite amount of stellar-based energies, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Stellar_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Stellar Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Stellar Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption\">Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Capacitor\" title=\"Electromagnetic Capacitor\">Electromagnetic Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Concentration\" title=\"Electromagnetic Concentration\">Electromagnetic Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Energizing\" title=\"Electromagnetic Energizing\">Electromagnetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Nuclear_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Nuclear Absorption\">Absolute Nuclear Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Capacitor\" title=\"Nuclear Capacitor\">Nuclear Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Concentration\" title=\"Nuclear Concentration\">Nuclear Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Conversion\" title=\"Nuclear Conversion\">Nuclear Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Energizing\" title=\"Nuclear Energizing\">Nuclear Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Quantum_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Quantum Absorption\">Absolute Quantum Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Capacitor\" title=\"Quantum Capacitor\">Quantum Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Concentration\" title=\"Quantum Concentration\">Quantum Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Conversion\" title=\"Quantum Conversion\">Quantum Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Energizing\" title=\"Quantum Energizing\">Quantum Energizing</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Stellar_Energy\" title=\"Personal Stellar Energy\">Personal Stellar Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Gravity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Gravity\">Personal Gravity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Nuclear_Power\" title=\"Personal Nuclear Power\">Personal Nuclear Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Solar_Energy\" title=\"Personal Solar Energy\">Personal Solar Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Accumulation\" title=\"Stellar Accumulation\">Stellar Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Concentration\" title=\"Stellar Concentration\">Stellar Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Regeneration\" title=\"Stellar Regeneration\">Stellar Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Attacks\" title=\"Stellar Attacks\">Stellar Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Capacitor\" title=\"Stellar Capacitor\">Stellar Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Conversion\" title=\"Stellar Conversion\">Stellar Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Energizing\" title=\"Stellar Energizing\">Stellar Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Stellar_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Stellar Transformer\">Bio-Stellar Transformer</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Empowerment\" title=\"Stellar Empowerment\">Stellar Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Immunity\" title=\"Stellar Immunity\">Stellar Immunity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Immunity\" title=\"Solar Immunity\">Solar Immunity</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Overload_Immunity\" title=\"Overload Immunity\">Overload Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Power\" title=\"Star Power\">Star Power</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Drain\" title=\"Total Drain\">Total Drain</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Absorption\">Omni-Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Anti-Monitor (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Darkseid (<i>DC Comics</i>); via Omega Effect</li>\n<li>Galactus (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); via Power Cosmic</li>\n<li>Genis-Vell (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); after fusing with Nega-Bands</li>\n<li>Hyperstorm (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>The Rot (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Vulcan (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Analysis_.26_Discussions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Analysis_&amp;_Discussions\">Analysis &amp; Discussions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Stellar_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"5f0fe8c6e87c450bbb49b741b310ae2a\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div clas